  "body": "<div data-page-id=\"doxcnSlopY9caJMnooKwxPLhvyd\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnoi4ckUIqgesey8OgFa5CTf\">You can set up the page-turn area in NeoReader based on your reading preference.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnEqGM8WcO4q6a2Ln8uUKCJg\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnm6qO062csGuOsBR9jxgAZg\">To set up the page-turn area, do the following:</div>\n<ol>\n<li>Tap any book file in the <strong>Library</strong> to open <strong>NeoReader</strong>.</li>\n<li>Tap the center area to display the main menu.</li>\n<li>Tap the hamburger menu in the top right corner and choose <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Touch Settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Here you can choose one of the preset modes or customize your own settings.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnW4iSIK6omO2aopuclBFIWd\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnW4iSIK6omO2aopuclBFIWd\"><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/10753169180948\" alt=\"9.3-1.jpg\"></div>\n</div>"
